OL,3,GNEWSANo budget resolution reached yet,
OL,4,Asays O'Neill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state is understood to
OL,7,Fhave presented a set of conditions,
OL,8,Fincluding revenue raising, to be
OL,9,Fattached to any potential deal on a
OL,10,FStormont budget.
